block head
    title Celiac Disease - Plants Cause Disease

block content
    h1 Celiac Disease
    p Definition by #[a(href="https://www.mayoclinic.org/diseases-conditions/celiac-disease/symptoms-causes/syc-20352220") Mayo Clinic]:
    blockquote Celiac disease is an illness caused by an immune reaction to eating gluten. Gluten is a protein found in foods containing wheat, barley or rye.
